This project is a fork of openapi-typescript (https://github.com/openapi-ts/openapi-typescript),
taken at upstream commit d46a319a (2026-09-25), with its full git history.

The upstream project was created by Drew Powers and maintained by the openapi-ts team and
more than 240 contributors. Its author announced on 2026-09-19 that the project would no
longer be maintained (https://github.com/openapi-ts/openapi-typescript/issues/2874).
This fork continues the work so that existing users have a maintained, drop-in successor.

Package mapping:

  openapi-typescript          -> openapi-typesafe
  openapi-fetch               -> openapi-typesafe-fetch
  openapi-typescript-helpers  -> openapi-typesafe-helpers
  openapi-react-query         -> openapi-typesafe-react-query

